  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring &amp; Evaluation of the PRSP and Reform Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This activity will help the Ministery of Planning and International Cooperation in the monitoring and evaluation of development indicators.  The key objective is to enhance the institutional and individual M&amp;E competencies of staff in MOPIC and across selected sector ministries to help operationalize and maintain the M&amp;E system in line with the M&amp;E strategycomma with specific focus on poverty monitoring. The objective will be achieved through the following actions: 1)  Training in reviewing and aligning outcome indicators across various policy documents including the DPPR (update of the PRSP)comma the Third Five Year Economic Plan (TFYP)comma and MDGscomma with a focus on poverty reduction; 2)  Training on the development of a &quot;&quot;master plan&quot;&quot; which will include the technical and administrative steps for operationalizing the M&amp;E strategycomma linking outcomescomma inputs and outputs in a coherent manner vis-a-vis poverty reduction goals. 3)  Training on data generation analysis and reporting of information to track poverty trends and participation while linking to sector performancecomma in technical workshops.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
